# SQAuto Verification Checklist

- [ ] Navigate to `http://sqauto.zeraynce.com/` (HTTP only)
- [ ] Verify dashboard loads successfully
- [ ] Verify 5 cards: TABLES, ROWS, DATA EXTRACTED, DUPLICATE DATA, READINESS
- [ ] Verify polling shows 200 OK (no "Network Error" alerts)
- [ ] Verify UI is polished and responsive

## Notes
- Ensure browsers are not forcing HTTPS.
- Check network logs for polling status.
